{"id":"474498160","kind":"article","title":"大众媒介通常不善于帮助人们落实想法","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zu8VWFVs7gxjMN75cfo1eNDmKnUBPtCzgAM"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-03-03","updated":"2022-09-06","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":708,"keywords":["大众媒介","情景体验","赋能环境","知识实践","MOOC"],"summary":"作者认为书籍、视频等大众媒介往往只能传递信息，难以让读者把想法落实为实践，因为它们缺少长期互动和具体情境。文章以 MOOC 未充分实现这一目标为例，提出“情景体验”或许能成为支持实践的媒介，但未给出完整解决方案。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/474498160","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"UPn04bvt\">书籍、录像和其他典型大众媒体本身并不是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z63gaUtZqb9mMUKRf85UhtEFPMgBBJbqvT2r8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参与式环境</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，脱离了其自身提供的语境，它们一般都不能很好地促进外部性参与。也就是说，它们通常不能创造一个<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3DaBP4vN1dutjUgrk3jbEeNxScccvDCxDgXe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赋能环境</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"BNekDJ66\">阅读信息媒介的经验，与将其付诸实践的经验，两者之间存在重大脱节。这种脱节部分上是时间层面的问题：想要利用材料，你需要花费的时间应超过仅仅阅读（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7JZswHPm99BbpTnb7NcP9Rnp8Bs6jsM3zjdv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大众媒介大多缺乏超过一天的创制时间维度</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>）。但情境问题也是一方面。</p><p data-pid=\"VjVyQPrU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2F3NLudCKZWYq2crjEbGDuYRy7DA7dcsjAG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MOOC</a> 试图解决这个问题，但基本上失败了。这值得我们更多地反思一下原因。</p><p data-pid=\"RbbjKYZk\">一个潜在的解决方案是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6oXuXLZ7Wq1eBqskyfph2wz9gjohQUKSBFzx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验作为一种大众媒介具有难以置信的潜力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。可能也有其他方案。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"g9GLRQXO\">Elizier Yudkowsky 为《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》所作的序言：<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/rationality/preface\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">lesswrong.com/rationali</span><span class=\"invisible\">ty/preface</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><blockquote data-pid=\"F6qqTvfg\">我写作中的第一个最大错误是——我没有意识到「弄清楚如何实践而不是知道理论」是学习这种有价值的思维方式的最大问题。我不知道到实践是重点，关于它我只能说「呀」和「嘿」。</blockquote><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"xa2vzHsd\">问：Elizier Yudkowsky 认为他在 Less Wrong 的博客犯的最大错误是什么？<br/>答：专注于理论而不是实践。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"uk70mIrm\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">赋能环境</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"cCsK7CFa\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zu8VWFVs7gxjMN75cfo1eNDmKnUBPtCzgAM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mass mediums are typically bad at helping people translate ideas to practice (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 参与式环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"551039707\" href=\"#/post/551039707\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 赋能环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 大众媒介大多缺乏超过一天的创制时间维度 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"484480982\" href=\"#/post/484480982\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 情景体验成为大众媒体时蕴藏极大潜力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"473212636\" href=\"#/post/473212636\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"473212636","title":"情景体验成为大众媒体时蕴藏极大潜力","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"476696005","title":"大多数解释型媒体对参与者提出了沉重的元认知要求","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"551039707","title":"参与式环境","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"484480982","title":"大众媒介大多缺乏超过一天的创制时间维度","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"458337989","title":"赋能环境","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":32,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}